 512  * ================= The gravity-code starts here ======================   *
 513  *====== Indicators used to split national SAM between regions ==================
 514  Parameter
 515  *indicIO(sec,sec,reg)      indicator for regional production
 516  indicIO(reg,good,sec)      indicator for regional production
 517  * indicXD er ikke i bruk for tiden
 518  *indicXD(sec,sec,reg)      indicator for regional output
 519  indicCONS(reg,good)         indicator for regional households consumption
 520  indicCONSgov(reg,good)      indicator for regional households consumption
 521  indicEXP(reg,good)          indicator for regional exports by sector
 522  indicIMP(reg,sec)          indicator for regional imports by sector
 523  indicPROD(reg,sec)         indicator for regional production by sector
 524  indicLAB(reg,sec)          indicator for regional labor inputs by sector
 525  indicINV(reg,good)          indicator for regional labor inputs by sector
 526  *indic_trade(reg,reg2,sec)  trade indicator origin
 527  indic_trade(reg,reg)      trade indicator origin
 528  indic_trade1(reg,reg,sec) trade indicator destination
 529  indic_trade2(reg,reg,sec) trade indicator destination
 530  indic_trade3(reg,reg,sec) trade indicator destination
 531  capital(reg,sec)           capital or investments
 532  *indiccapital(reg,sec) er ikke i bruk
 533  *indiccapital(reg,sec)
